      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Based on the provided demographics, Zone 2 appears to be at a higher risk due to its lower median household income ($32k) and higher percentage of low-income and potentially high-crime neighborhoods. Additionally, the presence of public housing can be associated with higher crime rates. I would flag Zone 2 for increased patrol presence.",
